But if I want to play it safe and preserve the async semantics, I'll keep the Promise-based approach. The Promise API: use `util.promisify`? Can't apply it to fs.glob (because it has multiple signatures?). util.promisify(fs.glob) — promisify checks [util.promisify.custom], or inspects the function's last argument; fs.glob's last parameter is the callback — promisify(fs.glob) should work.

